WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:05.390
For a while, I was really angry all
of the time about having tinnitus.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.536
I think it was about not
having control over it,

00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:12.570
since nobody could seem
to tell me how to stop it.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:18.085
There was plenty of sites on the internet
that promised cures, but what I discovered

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:22.654
is most of those, they'd say these things
just so that they could make money.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.711
What I did learn is that tinnitus
is a sign of neural damage,

00:00:26.751 --> 00:00:30.030
and there's really no easy cure for it.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:37.330
If any at all, and so at that point
I was left to face my anger.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:46.001
Once I learned that by adding
sounds to my sound environment,

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:51.360
I was able to shift things
and I saw some changes.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.072
At that point, my tinnitus
was less and I could see

00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:58.869
that even though I can't control
the tinnitus or escape it,

00:00:58.909 --> 00:01:03.325
I was able to find ways to relax
and not let my anger overtake me,

00:01:03.365 --> 00:01:08.400
because I was not a happy camper
for a long time and not fun to be around.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.020
I was very frustrated.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:16.880
But in the greater scheme of things,
what I learned is that it's not going away.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:21.154
Tinnitus is going to be with me for a very
long time, probably my lifetime,

00:01:21.194 --> 00:01:26.180
and rather than fighting it, why not just
accept it and find ways to deal with it?

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:27.680
And so that's what I did.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.578
I learned coping strategies
that were very helpful to me,

00:01:31.618 --> 00:01:37.211
including stress reduction and relaxation
techniques that really helped

00:01:37.251 --> 00:01:43.900
me to sleep better at night and also
be a much better person to be around.
